om/networkException","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-06-17T22:03:15Z","updated_at":"2023-06-17T22:03:15Z","body":"I asked about how this could be implemented on Discord but nobody responded.\n\nAny kind of feedback is welcome, I'd like to get this to an upstreamable state eventually but I'll just carry this patch in production until then.\n\nMy specific use case is supporting this in the NixOS module. It doesn't have a convenient way of configuring acls currently but I'm planning to upstream that to nixpkgs soon as well regardless of this pr","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1595871909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"networkException","id":42888162,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODg4MTYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42888162?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException","html_url":"https://github.com/networkException","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"sha":"1dd7f193c9426b629db7ea12cfff4d9ad14005c0","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDFkZDdmMTkzYzk0MjZiNjI5ZGI3ZWExMmNmZmY0ZDlhZDE0MDA1YzA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/1dd7f193c9426b629db7ea12cfff4d9ad14005c0","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/1dd7f193c9426b629db7ea12cfff4d9ad14005c0","author":{"name":"networkException","email":"git@nwex.de","date":"2023-06-17T17:13:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"networkException","email":"git@nwex.de","date":"2023-06-18T11:24:23Z"},"tree":{"sha":"277bfc4326b090f387bf48b64ea10a63a16386fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/277bfc4326b090f387bf48b64ea10a63a16386fd"},"message":"Allow setting ForcedTags using the acls.hujson config file\n\nThis patch introduces a declarative way to set ForcedTags for machines.\n\nIf a \"forcedTags\" field is set in the acls.hujson file, the ForcedTags\nof machines will be overriden in the database based on the tags defined\nin the config file.\n\n```json\n{\n    \"hosts\": {\n        \"a\": \"fd7a:115c:a1e0::1\",\n        \"b\": \"fd7a:115c:a1e0::2\"\n    },\n    \"forcedTags\": {\n        \"tag:some-tag\": [\n            \"a\",\n            \"tag:some-other-tag\"\n        ],\n        \"tag:some-other-tag\": [\n            \"b\"\n        ]\n    }\n}\n```","parents":[{"sha":"b01f1f1867136d9b2d7b1392776eb363b482c525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b01f1f1867136d9b2d7b1392776eb363b482c525","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b01f1f1867136d9b2d7b1392776eb363b482c525"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQnHOtMiqr1icQmdvfjh3RDrmhDkQUCZI7pZwAKCRDjh3RDrmhD\nkfIcAQD5/HhkMD4cGNCp/vBxvUkl55NZWLJQu2A7oVDfChrhTgD/azuBu4hX0+OG\n5u/Hs6brsWR/hcv+m81BOr0o5456CwI=\n=35lo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 277bfc4326b090f387bf48b64ea10a63a16386fd\nparent b01f1f1867136d9b2d7b1392776eb363b482c525\nauthor networkException <git@nwex.de> 1687022025 +0200\ncommitter networkException <git@nwex.de> 1687087463 +0200\n\nAllow setting ForcedTags using the acls.hujson config file\n\nThis patch introduces a declarative way to set ForcedTags for machines.\n\nIf a \"forcedTags\" field is set in the acls.hujson file, the ForcedTags\nof machines will be overriden in the database based on the tags defined\nin the config file.\n\n```json\n{\n    \"hosts\": {\n        \"a\": \"fd7a:115c:a1e0::1\",\n        \"b\": \"fd7a:115c:a1e0::2\"\n    },\n    \"forcedTags\": {\n        \"tag:some-tag\": [\n            \"a\",\n            \"tag:some-other-tag\"\n        ],\n        \"tag:some-other-tag\": [\n            \"b\"\n        ]\n    }\n}\n```\n","verified_at":"2024-12-03T17:19:50Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":9560852378,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz885pBPGCzwAAAAI53wea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/9560852378","actor":{"login":"networkException","id":42888162,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODg4MTYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42888162?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException","html_url":"https://github.com/networkException","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/networkException/following{/ot